  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. Multiplying both sides of the given equation by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"38\"><mn>38</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"r equals 38 left parenthesis s plus t right parenthesis\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"r minus 38 equals s plus t\"><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction r Over 38 EndFraction equals s plus t\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>38</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"r plus 38 equals s plus t\"><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction r Over 38 EndFraction equals s plus t\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>38</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"38 r equals s plus t\"><mn>38</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction r Over 38 EndFraction equals s plus t\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>38</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>",
